OL,3,APassengers describe airport chaos as
OL,4,Aairlines trade body says this 'cannot
OL,5,Ahappen again'
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of thousands of people are
OL,8,Fthought to have been affected by flight
OL,9,Fcancellations and delays, caused by a
OL,10,Ftechnical problem at air traffic
OL,11,Fcontrol on Tuesday
OL,13,FTransport Secretary Heidi Alexander
OL,14,Fapologises "wholeheartedly to
OL,15,Fpassengers" and asks the UK Civil
OL,16,FAviation Authority to conduct an
OL,17,Findependent review
OL,19,FThe trade body for UK airlines says
OL,20,Fthis "simply cannot happen again", in a
OL,21,Fletter to Alexander
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
