OL,3,APassengers describe airport chaos as
OL,4,Aairlines trade body says this 'cannot
OL,5,Ahappen again'
OL,6,
OL,7,FImages show passengers sleeping on
OL,8,Fairport floors, with aviation analytics
OL,9,Ffirm Cirium saying more than 340
OL,10,Fflights were cancelled today - around
OL,11,F5% of the total
OL,13,FNewlyweds Sasha and James say "it feels
OL,14,Flike we will spend our honeymoon at
OL,15,FGatwick" - while one woman due to leave
OL,16,FTurkey on Tuesday is now stuck until
OL,17,FThursday
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
