OL,3,AUS to ban imports of some Canadian
OL,4,Aalcohol, dairy goods and motorbikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FDominic LeBlanc, Canada's trade
OL,7,Fminister, said the latest US measures
OL,8,Fwere "unjustified" and that he would
OL,9,Fwork to protect the country's workers,
OL,10,Ffamilies and businesses.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
