OL,3,ANorway's royal family waves to crowds
OL,4,Afrom palace balcony after King Harald's
OL,5,Afuneral
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe late monarch died in August after
OL,8,F35 years on the throne - here's a mini
OL,9,Fprofile of the 89-year-old. His son,
OL,10,FHaakon VIII, has now succeeded him
OL,12,FPrince of Wales is representing King
OL,13,FCharles III while Princess Royal -
OL,14,Fgodmother to the new Norwegian king -
OL,15,Fis in attendance but in a private
OL,16,Fcapacity
OL,18,FAs well as European royalty,
OL,19,Finternational figures such as King
OL,20,FAbdullah II of Jordan and Ukraine's
OL,21,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky are at the
OL,22,Ffuneral
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
